<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dagestan Oblast</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1860–1921</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dagestan">Dagestan</a> Oblast was a province of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a> in the eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caucasus">Caucasus</a>, created in 1860 after the defeat of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/imam-shamil">Imam Shamil</a>. The local khanates and shamkhalate were gradually abolished and their lands turned into districts under military administration. It was replaced by the Dagestan Autonomous Soviet Socialist Republic in 1921.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dagestan-oblast.jpg" alt="Dagestan Oblast" width="320" height="395" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nunuxxx · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dagestan_Oblast_ATD.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
